    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I was looking over my final scorebooks today. Everything... every note, every movement. It feels like there's nothing left to say. Like I've said everything I was ever meant to say. It's strange, looking at a life's work and realizing the peak has already passed. Now it's just... the long, slow fade toward nothing.",
